--- a/EN-Porter-GAP-1-time-×0.01s.md
+++ b/EN-Porter-GAP-1-time-×0.01s.md
@@ -27,7 +27,24 @@
 <!-- CARROT:AUTO:END PorterGap1 -->
 
 <!-- CARROT:MANUAL:BEGIN PorterGap1 -->
-<!-- CARROT:REVIEW reviewed-for="" -->
+<!-- CARROT:REVIEW reviewed-for="6b19411b9386b2e768ca687f0bd7cb14445623ecf78b08847f09bbe748e40399" reviewed-at="2026-10-29T00:00:00Z" -->
+<!-- CARROT:SECTION:BEGIN BEHAVIOR -->
+### Behavior
+
+Changes the Porter lead-button deceleration threshold at the selected GAP level. Higher values constrain at greater distance; optional below-30 cancellation uses the same lead threshold.
+<!-- CARROT:SECTION:END BEHAVIOR -->
+
+<!-- CARROT:SECTION:BEGIN USAGE -->
+### Usage
+
+100 means one second; changes apply immediately. Levels are independent, so configure increasing values for higher levels.
+<!-- CARROT:SECTION:END USAGE -->
+
+<!-- CARROT:SECTION:BEGIN REFERENCE -->
+### Reference
+
+Separate from planner TF. The distance threshold is max(7m, 5m + ego speed × time); this does not guarantee actual following distance, braking or stopping.
+<!-- CARROT:SECTION:END REFERENCE -->
 <!-- CARROT:MANUAL:END PorterGap1 -->
 
